{"id": "207789", "name": "מטריצת יעקובי של F:R³→R² – הזנת כל מקדם בנפרד", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f1", "params": ["x", "y", "z"], "body": "func1"}, {"name": "f2", "params": ["x", "y", "z"], "body": "func2"}, {"name": "F", "params": ["x", "y", "z"], "body": "matrix([f1(x,y,z)],[f2(x,y,z)])"}, {"name": "df", "params": ["x", "y", "z"], "body": "matrix([diff(f1(x,y,z),x), diff(f1(x,y,z),y), diff(f1(x,y,z),z)], [diff(f2(x,y,z),x), diff(f2(x,y,z),y), diff(f2(x,y,z),z)])"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>מצאו את מטריצת יעקובי של הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[F(x,y,z)={{CT:0}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>על מנת למנוע שגיאות הקלדה אתם מתבקשים להזין כל אחד ממקדמי המטריצה בנפרד.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ DF(x,y,z) = \\begin{pmatrix} a &amp; b &amp; c \\\\ d &amp; e &amp; f \\end{pmatrix} \\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\"><table style=\"margin:0 auto;direction:ltr\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px\">a=[[input:ans1]]</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px\">b=[[input:ans2]]</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px\">c=[[input:ans3]]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px\">d=[[input:ans4]]</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px\">e=[[input:ans5]]</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px\">f=[[input:ans6]]</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\"><table style=\"margin:6px auto 0;direction:ltr\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px 8px\">[[validation:ans1]]</td><td style=\"padding:2px 8px\">[[validation:ans2]]</td><td style=\"padding:2px 8px\">[[validation:ans3]]</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:2px 8px\">[[validation:ans4]]</td><td style=\"padding:2px 8px\">[[validation:ans5]]</td><td style=\"padding:2px 8px\">[[validation:ans6]]</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> גוזרים כל רכיב של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F\\)</span> לפי כל אחד מהמשתנים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span>; הנגזרות של הרכיב הראשון יוצרות את השורה הראשונה במטריצה, ושל הרכיב השני את השורה השנייה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — רכיבי הפונקציה</b><br>ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F:\\mathbb{R}^3\\to\\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span> שני רכיבים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f_1(x,y,z)={{CT:1}},\\qquad f_2(x,y,z)={{CT:2}} \\]</p>מטריצת יעקובי היא מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\times 3\\)</span>: בשורה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(i\\)</span> הנגזרות החלקיות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_i\\)</span> לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span>, בסדר הזה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — השורה הראשונה</b><br>גוזרים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_1\\)</span> לפי כל משתנה, כשהאחרים נחשבים קבועים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\partial f_1}{\\partial x}={{CT:3}},\\qquad \\frac{\\partial f_1}{\\partial y}={{CT:4}},\\qquad \\frac{\\partial f_1}{\\partial z}={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — השורה השנייה</b><br>באותו אופן עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_2\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\partial f_2}{\\partial x}={{CT:6}},\\qquad \\frac{\\partial f_2}{\\partial y}={{CT:7}},\\qquad \\frac{\\partial f_2}{\\partial z}={{CT:8}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ DF(x,y,z)={{CT:9}} \\]</p>כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b,c\\)</span> הם שלושת האיברים בשורה הראשונה ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d,e,f\\)</span> שלושת האיברים בשורה השנייה.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:Result]]", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה חלקית</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה שגויה</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-CALCULUS]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans6", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "cnt:0;\namat:matrix([ans1,ans2,ans3],[ans4,ans5,ans6]);\ncmp:zerofor (tans1);\nfor i:1 thru 2 do (for j:1 thru 3 do (cmp[i,j]:if is(equal(amat[i,j],tans1[i,j])) then (cnt:cnt+1, true) else false));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "amat", "tans": "df(x,y,z)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">יופי הגזירה שלכם נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>הגזירה שלכם שגויה. למעשה בדיוק <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({@cnt@}\\)</span> מכניסות המטריצה שלכם נכונות. המטריצה הבאה מראה בדיוק באילו קוארדינטות טעיתם ובאילו צדקתם:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{@cmp@}\\]</p></div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "cnt", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.16, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "cnt", "tans": "2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.32, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "cnt", "tans": "3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "cnt", "tans": "4", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.66, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-5-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "Result-5-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "cnt", "tans": "5", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.82, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-6-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-6-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c", "func1", "func2", "m", "n", "tans1"], "nvariants": 50}